cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the AI Character Memory Benchmark, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AI Character Memory Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark for evaluating long-term memory, relationship continuity,
  contextual recall, character consistency, and behavioral continuity in AI
  characters and conversational systems. The benchmark distinguishes memory
  retrieval (whether an AI can recover information from previous interactions)
  from memory continuity (whether that information remains relevant and affects
  future behavior), and reports a multidimensional profile with a standardized
  failure-mode taxonomy.
type: dataset
